## 104. A uniform three-task obstruction

For the later actual horizons

$$
\mathcal S_{\rm late}
=\{(-1/2)^{n-1}:n\ge2\}\cup\{0\},
\tag{104.1}
$$

define the triple regret

$$
\Gamma_T(s)=\inf_{\mathcal R\ {\rm CPTP}}
 \max\left\{e_{P_0}(\mathcal R;s),
 e_{P_2}(\mathcal R;s)-B,
 e_Q(\mathcal R;s)-\frac12\right\},
\qquad T=\{P_0,P_2,Q\}.
\tag{104.2}
$$

